    "long_instructions": "#### Make the ask clear\r\n\r\nYou’ll practice writing a button label that tells visitors exactly what will happen when they click.\r\n\r\n1. Look at the button on the page. It says “Click here.”\r\n2. Type a new label in the box, or pick one.\r\n3. Read the card that opens. Does your label have a clear verb (action word) and a next step?\r\n4. Try two or three more labels.\r\n\r\n*Example: Join the cleanup*\r\n\r\n**Check your prompt:** Does it start with a verb and say what happens next?",
